# } from Unstaged lands on a.txt's file header (hunk 0). A hides the file.
# `HEAD  a.txt` is the footer while that file is selected; intra.txt contains
# the substring a.txt, so do not wait for a.txt alone.
wait Unstaged
send }
wait HEAD  a.txt  hunk 0/
send A
gone HEAD  a.txt
wait HEAD  b.txt
approved a.txt
staged a.txt
